# Staged photographs, not assertions (GALLERY.md): a person opens each image. Pass: wsl-deps.gallery.map (NSB base map wsl-deps.sanctuary-nelim.map plus the lipstick map).
# SHOTLIST of 2026-11-17 (write-shotlist, first pass). Opus director pass kept: tighter zoom, tube counter 4-3-2-1, no mirror, Berry on Nelim, no red-on-red, hut at 18h and 19h, no walking pose. Not kept: Rose on Miel (Caramel is her validated lipstick), Gear-tab window (no step; the item card of 02-french already exists).
# STORY. "Four shades, one day". Nelim (protagonist, NSB canon) sets up a dressing corner on the veranda at 8h to help her friend Miel (lead) pick a lipstick for tea at the hut.
# Hours 8, 9, 10, 14, 18, 19, clear sky, one start hour per image, the light moves through the day. Nelim keeps her emerald LTS_Tunika all day (continuity), Miel changes once, at 18h, for tea (the story says so).
# The floor row of tubes counts the day: four tubes at 8h, three at 9h, two at 10h, none on the floor at 14h (worn or pocketed), one leftover Rose tube on the low table at 19h.
# Shade rule: each shade on the skin that contrasts with it. Caramel on Miel (validated by Virginie, 2026-11-17, VALIDE.md), Berry on Nelim (sand skin), Forest on Miel. Rose only as a tube.
# Nelim: LTS_Tunika dyed rgb (31, 122, 92) emerald, Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony, MouthLipsSmirk (canon, no mouth change), smile held. Miel: Roo_Royal_NaturalcurlsHD, MouthLipsBig, smile held; 8h to 14h VAE_Apparel_Overalls orange rgb (197, 138, 58) over cream UnderWhere_Chestwrap rgb (240, 232, 214) (validated 2026-11-17); at 18h cream UnderWhere_Chestwrap and green VAE_Apparel_Trousers rgb (34, 110, 66) (plain top so the green lips are the only strong colour).
# No colonist outside NSB, no colonist property changed, no animal (the mod adds none). DepMap additions beyond the NSB base map: none (Facial Animation 1635901197, VTE FA 2816938779, Stick Lantern, LTS, VAE, UnderWhere are all in it). Steps: all exist (StageDecor, ColonistRace, CameraZoom, InspectTabs).
# Gestures: pawns stand at a cell facing a direction, face held to a smile, game paused after 5 frames; no walking or carrying pose. Cells are read from the empty-place photos at the first ticket.
#   1. vanity-1-dressing-corner; terrace, centre (196, 123); 8h; zoom 3.2
#        Nelim at (195, 123) facing East, Miel at (197, 123) facing South with her bare default lips (the before); four tubes in a row at (195, 122), (196, 122), (197, 122), (198, 122): VanityCase_LipstickCaramel, VanityCase_LipstickRose, VanityCase_LipstickBerry, VanityCase_LipstickForest; Stool at (199, 123), TorchLamp lit at (194, 124), PlantPot with Plant_Daylily at (199, 124), Plant_YellowTallGrass at (193, 122), SculptureSmall at (198, 125).
#        Instant: Nelim has just held out the first tube. Says: Four shades, one morning. Frame: wide-medium, zoom 3.2 centred (196, 123); row of four tubes in the foreground centre, the two women behind, lit torch left, plants right; low warm 8h light. Type: story scene. Known weakness (j): the lips are small at 268 px, malus assumed.
#   2. vanity-2-caramel; terrace; 9h; zoom 2.6
#        Miel at (197, 123) facing South wearing VanityCase_LipstickCaramel, overalls, smiling; Nelim at (195, 123) facing East at the left edge; three tubes left at (196, 122), (197, 122), (198, 122) (Rose, Berry, Forest); Stool, PlantPot with Plant_Daylily at (199, 124), SculptureSmall, TorchLamp lit at (194, 124).
#        Instant: Miel has just put the colour on. Says: Miel tries Caramel. Frame: tight, zoom 2.6 centred (197, 123), Miel centred, head and shoulders; Nelim cropped at the left edge; tubes bottom; 9h light.
#   3. vanity-3-berry; terrace; 10h; zoom 2.4
#        Nelim at (196, 123) facing South wearing VanityCase_LipstickBerry, tunika, smiling; Miel (Caramel on, overalls) at the right edge at (198, 123) facing West; two tubes left at (195, 122) and (198, 122) (Rose, Forest); Stool, Plant_Daylily pot at (199, 124), Plant_YellowTallGrass at (193, 122).
#        Instant: Nelim has just tried the next shade and glances at Miel. Says: Berry suits Nelim. Frame: tight, zoom 2.4 centred (196, 123); Nelim left of centre, Miel's shoulder foreground right, tubes foreground left; 10h light.
#   4. vanity-4-cloister; cloister; 14h; zoom 3
#        Both standing under the torii side by side, facing South: Nelim at (177, 127) in Berry, Miel at (179, 127) in Caramel, same outfits as the morning, smiling; the wall lanterns of the cloister, TorchLamp lit at (176, 129), PlantPot with Plant_Daylily at (181, 127), Plant_YellowTallGrass at (175, 127).
#        Instant: they have just set out for tea. Says: Two shades on the way to tea. Frame: medium, zoom 3 centred (178, 127); both faces in the upper third, torii behind, lantern and plants grouped at the right; 14h light. Bridge image between 10h and 18h.
#   5. vanity-5-forest; hut; 18h; zoom 2.4
#        Miel at (141, 73) facing South in VanityCase_LipstickForest, cream UnderWhere_Chestwrap and green VAE_Apparel_Trousers, smiling; the andon lamp of the hut (native), DR_StickLantern lit at (139, 73), Stool at (143, 73), PlantPot with Plant_Daylily at (143, 74), Plant_YellowTallGrass at (139, 74).
#        Instant: she has just changed for tea and chosen the last shade. Says: Miel chooses Forest. Frame: tight, zoom 2.4 centred (141, 73); head and shoulders against the wooden wall; warm lamp light at 18h.
#   6. vanity-6-tea; hut; 19h; zoom 5
#        Both standing at the low table facing South: Miel in Forest at (140, 73), Nelim in Berry at (142, 73), smiling; one leftover VanityCase_LipstickRose tube at (141, 74); the andon lamp, DR_StickLantern lit at (139, 73) and at (143, 73), PlantPot with Plant_Daylily at (143, 74); no TorchLamp indoors.
#        Instant: the tea is poured, the day is done. Says: Four shades, three chosen. Frame: wide closing, zoom 5 centred (141, 73); the whole hut corner, both women in the middle, tube and lit lamps in the foreground, plants at the edges; dusk light from the lamps. Known weakness (j): lips small at 268 px, malus assumed.
#   7. vanity-7-item-card; window-backdrop-for-height, centre (90, 140); 12h; interface window
#        The info card of VanityCase_LipstickCaramel (Stats tab), cropped at the window, no subtitle, taken last. Decor: the item placed at (90, 140). Not scored.
# Interface windows: shot 7 only (the mod has no settings page).
